---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import MoreProducts from '../components/MoreProducts.astro';
---
<Layout title="Raceway - Swastik Industries" current="products-sub">
<main><div class="page-hero"><img class="bg" src="/assets/products/raceway.webp" alt=""><div class="wrap"><div class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/products">Products</a> / Raceway</div><h1>Raceway</h1><p>Manufactured in different sizes and specifications, customisable to the client's requirement.</p></div></div><section class=""><div class="wrap"><div class="split "><div class="tx"><div class="eyebrow">Cable management</div><h2>Raceways</h2><p class="lede">Electrical raceways feature a continuous enclosed channel with a rigid structural profile containing a smooth interior for routing conductors.</p><p class="lede">The solid enclosure provides superior physical protection for the wires, preventing environmental damage and accidental impact while still offering a streamlined, compact footprint that securely houses power, data, or communication lines.</p>
<div class="tablewrap" style="width:100%"><table class="sched"><tbody><tr><td>Sheet thickness</td><td class="v">1.6 mm to 3.0 mm</td></tr><tr><td>Standard length</td><td class="v">2.5 m or 3.0 m</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
</div>
<div><img src="/assets/products/raceway.webp" alt="Raceway with cover" loading="lazy"></div></div>
<div class="spec-row"><div class="matcard"><h3>Raw material</h3><ul class="matlist"><li>Mild steel</li><li>Pre-galvanised sheet</li><li>Stainless steel</li><li>Aluminium</li></ul></div><div class="matcard"><h3>Finish</h3><ul class="matlist"><li>Pre-galvanised sheet</li><li>Hot dip galvanised</li><li>Powder coated</li><li>Painted</li></ul></div><div class="matcard"><h3>Accessories</h3><ul class="matlist"><li>C channel</li><li>Junction box</li><li>Strut channel</li><li>Cantilever arm</li><li>C1 channel</li></ul></div></div></div></section><MoreProducts current="raceway" />
<section class="cta-band"><div class="wrap"><h2>Share your requirements with us</h2><a class="btn" href="/contact">Request a quote</a></div></section></main>
</Layout>
